    "Earlier runs FAILED at 04_choose_spore: on the phone champion list a finger swipe that starts on a card (or a panel) did not scroll the list, so the Spore Sage's Choose button could not be reached by touch.",
    "Fixed: CardView and ChoiceTile now use MOUSE_FILTER_PASS and fire on release when the pointer moved <= 14 px (a drag over them scrolls instead of picking); UiKit.vscroll lists set non-button panels to PASS so touches reach the ScrollContainer.",
    "Swipes are slow (20 moves over 5 s) because the emulated game runs at ~1-2 fps; fast swipes bunched into one frame did not scroll in this emulation.",
